      "writtenOn": "2022-12-13T21:31:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m assuming there\u0027s some cost to allowing this? (Not saying we shouldn\u0027t do it, but it\u0027s interesting that we have to define a macro in order to allow it.)\n\nCould callers just manually use `::perfetto::DynamicString`?",
