      "writtenOn": "2022-12-13T21:31:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this to support our `ALWAYS` versions of the macros? I think the plan is to *not* carry this over to the new system. If Android always wants a category, they should just turn it on always.\n\nSee go/skia-tracing-2022. I thought I had shared this with you, but it looks like I have not :face-palm",
